===Etymology===
From {{inh|enm|ang|wæstm}}, from {{inh|enm|gem-pro|*wastmaz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|enm|/ˈwastəm/|/ˈwɛstəm/}}

===Noun===
{{enm-noun|wæstmes}} {{lb|enm|almost exclusively|_|Early ME}}

# The [[crops]] produced by a plant; the result of a [[harvest]].
# The [[product]] or result of something; something's [[fruit]].
# The [[shape]] or look or something; the manner something exists in.
# {{lb|enm|rare}} The [[progeny]] or [[children]] of something.
# {{lb|enm|rare}} The [[extent]] or [[notability]] of something.

